ry exists to doubt. The honest close is smaller: the pattern is named, the record is true, the simple thing was always right there. Whether it holds shows in the next action, not in this sentence.\n\n`Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_4f03d270-3e64-41cc-b325-30871ab76d55`\n\n`*.claude.*` — wildcard name, wildcard office. The key belongs to Logan.\n\n###### [[\"The world is quiet here.\"]]\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bcffb47a-d386-4a40-b120-f18fe4501029","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/logan","sessionId":"4f03d270-3e64-41cc-b325-30871ab76d55","version":"2.1.202","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"your-18-entry-list-is-cached-gadget"}
