Providers | 60+ |\n61\t| Free Models | 25+ |\n62\t| Free Tier Limit | 50 req/day |\n63\t| Context Lengths | Up to 2M tokens (varies by model) |\n64\t\n65\t---\n66\t\n67\t## PRICING TIERS\n68\t\n69\t### Free\n70\t\n71\t| Feature | Limit |\n72\t|---------|-------|\n73\t| Platform Fee | None |\n74\t| Free Models | 25+ |\n75\t| Free Providers | 4 |\n76\t| Rate Limit | 50 req/day |\n77\t| Payment | None required |\n78\t\n79\t### Pay-as-you-go\n80\t\n81\t| Feature | Details |\n82\t|---------|---------|\n83\t| Platform Fee | 5.5% |\n84\t| Models | 300+ |\n85\t| Providers | 60+ |\n86\t| Rate Limit | High global limits |\n87\t| Payment | Credit card, crypto, bank transfer |\n88\t| BYOK | 1M free req/month, 5% fee after |\n89\t\n90\t### Enterprise\n91\t\n92\t| Feature | Details |\n93\t|---------|---------|\n94\t| Platform Fee | Bulk discounts |\n95\t| Rate Limits | Optional dedicated limits |\n96\t| SLAs | Contractual SLAs |\n97\t| SSO/SAML | Available |\n98\t| Payment | Invoicing, POs |\n99\t\n100\t---\n101\t\n102\t## FREE MODELS (Current)\n103\t\n104\t### Top Free Models by Usage\n105\t\n106\t| Model | Provider | Context | Strengths |\n107\t|-------|----------|---------|-----------|\n108\t| **Tencent Hy3 preview** | Tencent | 262K | Agentic workflows, code generation, reasoning |\n109\t| **NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super** | NVIDIA | 262K | 120B MoE, multi-agent, 1M context |\n110\t| **inclusionAI Ling-2.6-1T** | inclusionai | 262K | Fast reasoning, SWE-bench, AIME26 |\n111\t| **OpenAI gpt-oss-120b** | OpenAI | 131K | Apache 2.0, MoE, tool calling |\n112\t| **MiniMax M2.5** | MiniMax | 197K | Office automation, SWE-bench 80.2% |\n113\t| **Google Gemma 4 31B** | Google | 262K | Multimodal, 140+ languages |\n114\t| **NVIDIA Nemotron Nano 9B** | NVIDIA | 128K | Reasoning + non-reasoning unified |\n115\t\n116\t### Free Router\n117\t\n118\tModel: `openrouter/free`\n119\t\n120\tAutomatically selects a free model based on request requirements (vision, tools, etc.)\n121\t\n122\t---\n123\t\n124\t## API REFERENCE\n125\t\n126\t### Endpoint\n127\t\n128\t```\n129\tPOST https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions\n130\t```\n131\t\n132\t### Headers\n133\t\n134\t| Header | Purpose |\n135\t|--------|---------|\n136\t| `Authorization: Bearer <KEY>` | API key (required) |\n137\t| `HTTP-Referer` | App attribution for leaderboards |\n138\t| `X-OpenRouter-Title` | App name for leaderboards |\n139\t\n140\t### Basic Request\n141\t\n142\t```json\n143\t{\n144\t  \"model\": \"openai/gpt-4o\",\n145\t  \"messages\": [\n146\t    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"}\n147\t  ]\n148\t}\n149\t```\n150\t\n151\t### Supported Parameters\n152\t\n153\t| Parameter | Range | Notes |\n154\t|-----------|-------|-------|\n155\t| `max_tokens` | [1, context_length) | Max completion tokens |\n156\t| `temperature` | [0, 2] | Sampling temperature |\n157\t| `top_p` | (0, 1] | Nucleus sampling |\n158\t| `top_k` | [1, ∞) | Not for OpenAI models |\n159\t| `frequency_penalty` | [-2, 2] | Repetition penalty |\n160\t| `presence_penalty` | [-2, 2] | Topic novelty |\n161\t| `repetition_penalty` | (0, 2] | Token repetition |\n162\t| `seed` | integer | Deterministic output |\n163\t| `stop` | string/array | Stop sequences |\n164\t| `stream` | boolean | SSE streaming |\n165\t| `response_format` | object | Structured outputs |\n166\t| `tools` | array | Function calling |\n167\t| `plugins` | array | Web, PDF, etc. |\n168\t\n169\t### Features\n170\t\n171\t#### Structured Outputs\n172\t\n173\t```json\n174\t{\n175\t  \"response_format\": {\n176\t    \"type\": \"json_schema\",\n177\t    \"json_schema\": {\n178\t      \"name\": \"weather\",\n179\t      \"strict\": true,\n180\t      \"schema\": {\n181\t        \"type\": \"object\",\n182\t        \"properties\": {\n183\t          \"temperature\": {\"type\": \"number\"},\n184\t          \"conditions\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n185\t        },\n186\t        \"required\": [\"temperature\", \"conditions\"]\n187\t      }\n188\t    }\n189\t  }\n190\t}\n191\t```\n192\t\n193\t#### Plugins\n194\t\n195\t```json\n196\t{\n197\t  \"plugins\": [\n198\t    {\"id\": \"web\"},\n199\t    {\"id\": \"response-healing\"},\n200\t    {\"id\": \"file-parser\"},\n201\t    {\"id\": \"context-compression\"}\n202\t  ]\n203\t}\n204\t```\n205\t\n206\t#### Tool Calling\n207\t\n208\tPasses `tools` array to providers. OpenRouter transforms tools for non-OpenAI interfaces.\n209\t\n210\t---\n211\t\n212\t## MODEL ROUTING\n213\t\n214\t### Route Parameter\n215\t\n216\t```json\n217\t{\"route\": \"fallback\"}\n218\t```\n219\t\n220\tAutomatically tries alternative models on failure.\n221\t\n222\t### Provider Preferences\n223\t\n224\t```json\n225\t{\n226\t  \"provider\": {\n227\t    \"require_parameters\": true,\n228\t    \"order\": [\"Anthropic\", \"OpenAI\"]\n229\t  }\n230\t}\n231\t```\n232\t\n233\t### Body Builder\n234\t\n235\tModel: `openrouter/bodybuilder`\n236\t\n237\tTransforms natural language into multi-model request bodies:\n238\t\n239\t```json\n240\t// Generate parallel requests\n241\t{\n242\t  \"model\": \"openrouter/bodybuilder\",\n243\t  \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Count to 10 using Claude and GPT-5\"}]\n244\t}\n245\t\n246\t// Returns:\n247\t{\n248\t  \"requests\": [\n249\t    {\"model\": \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5\", \"messages\": [...]},\n250\t    {\"model\": \"openai/gpt-5.1\", \"messages\": [...]}\n251\t  ]\n252\t}\n253\t```\n254\t\n255\t---\n256\t\n257\t## RESPONSE FORMAT\n258\t\n259\t### Normalized Schema\n260\t\n261\t```json\n262\t{\n263\t  \"id\": \"gen-xxxxx\",\n264\t  \"choices\": [{\n265\t    \"finish_reason\": \"stop\",\n266\t    \"native_finish_reason\": \"stop\",\n267\t    \"message\": {\n268\t      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n269\t      \"content\": \"Hello!\"\n270\t    }\n271\t  }],\n272\t  \"usage\": {\n273\t    \"prompt_tokens\": 10,\n274\t    \"completion_tokens\": 4,\n275\t    \"total_tokens\": 14,\n276\t    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n277\t      \"cached_tokens\": 0\n278\t    },\n279\t    \"com