{"parentUuid":"b87f23cc-b4a7-47a0-ba54-b44344149294","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"376eaed9-c49d-4863-93c8-4b884393f3cc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012WxLciXSyZBJi5uYcCjHV3","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OpenClaw Node Android app chat message no reply agent does not respond\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"How to Fix OpenClaw UI Chat Not Responding\",\"url\":\"https://www.ucartz.com/blog/how-to-fix-openclaw-ui-chatwindow-not-responding/\"},{\"title\":\"[Bug]: Ollama local model never responds in chat — CPU-only Ubuntu (no GPU) · Issue #18874 · openclaw/openclaw\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/18874\"},{\"title\":\"Android app · OpenClaw\",\"url\":\"https://docs.openclaw.ai/platforms/android\"},{\"title\":\"Messages not appearing in web chat, no response from openclaw - Friends of the Crustacean 🦞🤝\",\"url\":\"https://www.answeroverflow.com/m/1469702064765665404\"},{\"title\":\"Openclaw bot not responding after initial message\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/openclawusers/posts/687873661041577/\"},{\"title\":\"[Bug]: Agent becomes completely unresponsive during Skill installation and does not report task completion · Issue #52073 · openclaw/openclaw\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/52073\"},{\"title\":\"[Bug]: Sending message without response · Issue #11992 · openclaw/openclaw\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/11992\"},{\"title\":\"[Bug]: OpenClaw accepts tasks but agents often do not execute them, return placeholder replies, and activity/log visibility is inconsistent · Issue #40082 · openclaw/openclaw\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/40082\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here are the key findings about the OpenClaw Node Android app chat message \"no reply\" issue:\n\n## Common Causes\n\nThe most common reason the chat doesn't respond is that OpenClaw has no AI model connected to process your messages. The Android app is a companion node and requires a running OpenClaw Gateway.\n\n## Main Issues\n\n1. **Missing AI Model Connection**: The fix is simply connecting an AI brain to your agent. Once that connection exists, OpenClaw transforms from a dashboard into a fully interactive AI assistant. Without configuring a model provider, the agent has nowhere to send your messages for processing.\n\n2. **Gateway WebSocket Problems**: If the web chat stops updating, the two most common buckets are: 1) the UI lost the Gateway WebSocket (proxy/ingress timeouts, reconnect bugs, pod moved), or 2) the Gateway/agent is hung but you're not looking at the right logs (file log vs stdout), so it looks \"silent\".\n\n3. **Ollama-Specific Issue**: OpenClaw chat never returns a response when configured with a local Ollama model, showing a permanent \"thinking\" indicator with no error message. Gateway logs show \"Error: Unknown model: ollama/llama3.2\" and \"Embedded agent failed before reply\".\n\n4. **API Credit Exhaustion**: You configured everything correctly, services are running, the model is set up, but chat doesn't work because you've already exhausted your API credits without realizing it.\n\nThe issue typically appears as a silent, unresponsive chat interface with no error messages displayed to the user.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"617cf20d-894f-446e-bbe1-3d9e6db4ed64","timestamp":"2026-07-07T12:43:23.497Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"OpenClaw Node Android app chat message no reply agent does not respond","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Nii7KwUU5AwyGLN61RR2AA","content":[{"title":"How to Fix OpenClaw UI Chat Not Responding","url":"https://www.ucartz.com/blog/how-to-fix-openclaw-ui-chatwindow-not-responding/"},{"title":"[Bug]: Ollama local model never responds in chat — CPU-only Ubuntu (no GPU) · Issue #18874 · openclaw/openclaw","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openc