ey Android Features\nAndroid provider/model screens now surface expiring, unavailable, unresolved, and attention states more clearly, Android adds theme mode selection. Native app localization expands across Apple and Android surfaces.\n\n### Node/Chat Features\nCLI and node workflows add openclaw attach, node context-path support, actionable device-approval recovery guidance, soft-resume CLI sessions when prompt metadata changes.\n\n### Known Issues\nLong-context compaction is a known operator risk where large sessions where the 60-second aggregate compaction wait abandons valid summaries that finish around 143-190 seconds, causing overflow and retry storms. Additionally, provider and tool contracts need normalization with fresh reports covering Google provider API-key rotation, Z.AI stale auth-profile cache, and Bedrock provider registration issues.\n\nThe official OpenClaw GitHub repository (openclaw/openclaw) maintains the canonical changelog and release notes for all versions.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"f7e20c5f-52cd-43f5-97be-6d7623f38624","timestamp":"2026-07-07T12:43:42.742Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"OpenClaw Android app github release changelog 2026 node chat known issues","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MDvwvZAaLJ3dtDdvmmeGKQ","content":[{"title":"Releases · openclaw/openclaw","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/releases"},{"title":"OpenClaw Release Notes - July 2026 Latest Updates - Releasebot","url":"https://releasebot.io/updates/openclaw"},{"title":"OpenClaw Releases - Version History & Updates","url":"https://openclaw-hub.com/releases/"},{"title":"OpenClaw Changelog: 2026 Release Notes and Updates | Fastio","url":"https://fast.io/resources/openclaw-changelog-guide/"},{"title":"Release policy · OpenClaw","url":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/reference/RELEASING"},{"title":"Release openclaw 2026.6.5 · openclaw/openclaw","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/o