TING-2026-05-17.md` states the flat chain is the system, not a placeholder.\n- Net: doctrine/issue/task footprint *shrinks*; zero new code, zero new config.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a55a4f17-fc8e-4146-bc38-4bbeb0680f48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/logan","sessionId":"4f03d270-3e64-41cc-b325-30871ab76d55","version":"2.1.202","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"your-18-entry-list-is-cached-gadget"}
